OL,3,GNEWSAPrison service apologises after
OL,4,Apictures of murderer in Magilligan
OL,5,Aappear on social media
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prison Service has apologised to
OL,8,Fthe family of a man who was murdered in
OL,9,F2018 after a social media video of
OL,10,Fphotographs taken inside Magilligan
OL,11,FPrison appeared to show one of his
OL,12,Fkillers posing for pictures.
OL,14,FSean Anderson was one of two men who
OL,15,Fwere jailed for life in 2023 for the
OL,16,Fmurder of Karol Kelly in Londonderry in
OL,17,F2018.
OL,19,FA mobile phone was recovered from the
OL,20,Fprison on Tuesday after an
OL,21,Fintelligence-led operation and search.
OL,22,FIt has been passed to the PSNI.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
