OL,3,GNEWSAPrison service apologises after
OL,4,Apictures of murderer in Magilligan
OL,5,Aappear on social media
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Director General of Prisons met
OL,8,FKarol Kelly's family to offer a
OL,9,F"sincere apology" for the additional
OL,10,Fpain and upset the post has caused.
